{"4506040": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Super Disposition", "steam_appid": 4506040, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Disposition</strong> is a physics-driven action adventure where you roll, fly, shoot, slice, and smash through a hostile planet. Features arcade-style combat, bullet-hell encounters, puzzles, interactive environments and shifting gameplay between third-person, side-scrolling, top-down, and fixed camera angles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is at the heart of the experience. The physics-driven controls feel organic and responsive, making even simple traversal enjoyable. Transform between two distinct forms, each with its own unique move sets. Roll, dodge, jump, and glide as a ball, or switch to an omnidirectional rocket capable of flying freely in any direction. The rocket gives you total movement freedom, but mastering it takes skill. It is challenging at first, then rewarding once you learn how to control its speed, direction, and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/0642f1fd14e154c5772bdaf65bc53afb.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/0642f1fd14e154c5772bdaf65bc53afb.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/0642f1fd14e154c5772bdaf65bc53afb.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and action-packed, combat is built around quick reactions and constant movement. Wield a variety of unique weapons, each serving a distinct purpose and encouraging different approaches to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/963adbb0af0fc2052e844010e8192f47.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/963adbb0af0fc2052e844010e8192f47.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/963adbb0af0fc2052e844010e8192f47.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SLICE AND SMASH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip two distinct melee weapons. Both weapons interact with the physical world, allowing you to slice, smash, and carve your way through combat encounters and environmental objects. World is your playground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/5d8cc95c44826895b1e9c416101a0d5e.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/5d8cc95c44826895b1e9c416101a0d5e.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/5d8cc95c44826895b1e9c416101a0d5e.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC PERSPECTIVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The camera dynamically shifts between 3D, side-scrolling 2.5D, top-down, and fixed-angle perspectives. Combined with two different movement modes, these perspective changes create varied gameplay experiences throughout the game.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/4dee0636e6e5a83c3613b552216501ed.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/4dee0636e6e5a83c3613b552216501ed.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/4dee0636e6e5a83c3613b552216501ed.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/81bc427b4fdc37729bfc499b81cdaf4b.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/81bc427b4fdc37729bfc499b81cdaf4b.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/81bc427b4fdc37729bfc499b81cdaf4b.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnets</strong>: A physics-based magnet system connects the player with the environment. The battle android has a magnetic pole that can be changed depending on the situation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Encounters</strong>: Waves of projectile patterns that require precise timing and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lasers</strong>: Lots of lasers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/726fe1baef2490728e3983aff2586daa.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/726fe1baef2490728e3983aff2586daa.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/726fe1baef2490728e3983aff2586daa.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an open world built around fast, free movement. Large open areas give room to build momentum, while more focused sections require precise control and careful navigation. The world supports both grounded traversal and full flight. Gain enough height, and you can even fly into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/32e1be143f7d2b826de51824fd7f8f87.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/32e1be143f7d2b826de51824fd7f8f87.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/32e1be143f7d2b826de51824fd7f8f87.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Super Disposition</strong> is a physics-driven action adventure where you roll, fly, shoot, slice, and smash through a hostile planet. Features arcade-style combat, bullet-hell encounters, puzzles, interactive environments and shifting gameplay between third-person, side-scrolling, top-down, and fixed camera angles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MOVEMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement is at the heart of the experience. The physics-driven controls feel organic and responsive, making even simple traversal enjoyable. Transform between two distinct forms, each with its own unique move sets. Roll, dodge, jump, and glide as a ball, or switch to an omnidirectional rocket capable of flying freely in any direction. The rocket gives you total movement freedom, but mastering it takes skill. It is challenging at first, then rewarding once you learn how to control its speed, direction, and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/0642f1fd14e154c5772bdaf65bc53afb.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/0642f1fd14e154c5772bdaf65bc53afb.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/0642f1fd14e154c5772bdaf65bc53afb.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced and action-packed, combat is built around quick reactions and constant movement. Wield a variety of unique weapons, each serving a distinct purpose and encouraging different approaches to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/963adbb0af0fc2052e844010e8192f47.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/963adbb0af0fc2052e844010e8192f47.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati