video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/81bc427b4fdc37729bfc499b81cdaf4b.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/81bc427b4fdc37729bfc499b81cdaf4b.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/81bc427b4fdc37729bfc499b81cdaf4b.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magnets</strong>: A physics-based magnet system connects the player with the environment. The battle android has a magnetic pole that can be changed depending on the situation.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Encounters</strong>: Waves of projectile patterns that require precise timing and positioning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lasers</strong>: Lots of lasers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/726fe1baef2490728e3983aff2586daa.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/726fe1baef2490728e3983aff2586daa.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/726fe1baef2490728e3983aff2586daa.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features an open world built around fast, free movement. Large open areas give room to build momentum, while more focused sections require precise control and careful navigation. The world supports both grounded traversal and full flight. Gain enough height, and you can even fly into space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/32e1be143f7d2b826de51824fd7f8f87.poster.avif?t=1781379968\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/32e1be143f7d2b826de51824fd7f8f87.webm?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/extras/32e1be143f7d2b826de51824fd7f8f87.mp4?t=1781379968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A physics-driven action adventure where you roll, fly, shoot, slice, and smash through a hostile planet.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/c7db4da0305a21cff59afed3099d8432aa9f7aae/header.jpg?t=1781379968", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/e4021aff5e5178b873ae6b154714e4eb08ea18cb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781379968", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4506040/e4021aff5e5178b873ae6b154714e4eb08ea18cb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781379968", "website": "https://ulvizm.com/SuperDisposition", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Direct